  "ms:rubrication": "Section headers, bismillah keywords, and transition particles in vermilion red",
  "ms:transcriptionArabic": "بِسْمِ اللهِ الرَّحْمَنِ الرَّحِيمِ - الحمد لله الواحد الأحد الصمد المصور ومهيمن كل وجود وجاعل كل موجود والصلوة على من قفاه من زمر الانبياء واصطفاه من رسل الرسل... والقوانين فيما قد استبان لعين عقل مقلة قلبي ببصيرة رؤى بنور الهبة في طول المدتين ان رتب الابداع والتكوين تنفرد بالقدم وبقاء الدوام...",
  "ms:translationEnglish": "In the Name of God, the Most Gracious, the Most Merciful. Praise be to God, the One, the Unique, the Eternal Refuge, the Fashioner and Guardian of all being, the Creator of every existent; and blessings upon him whom He chose from among the ranks of prophets and messengers... And the principles that have become clear to the eye of reason and inner insight through the luminous bestowal over the two durations: namely, that the ranks of origination (ibdāʿ) and cosmic formation (takwīn) are uniquely characterized by eternity and perpetual subsistence...",
  "ms:features": [
